          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us take the marked 2 × 2 square, and consider the numbers lying on the diagonals; 12 and 20; 13 and 19. Find their sums; 12 + 20, 13 + 19. What do you observe?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.347,
            0.347,
            0.505,
            0.366
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "They are equal."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.365,
            0.846,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us extend the numbers in the calendar beyond 30, creating endless rows."
