            0.709
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Will the diagonal sums be equal in every 2 × 2 square in this endless grid? How can we be sure?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.718,
            0.846,
            0.756
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "To be sure of this we cannot check with all 2 × 2 squares as there are an unlimited number of them."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.755,
            0.845,
            0.793
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us consider a 2 × 2 square. Its top left number can be any number. Let us call "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\mathrm { i } } { \\mathrm {  ~ \\bar { ~ } } } a ^ { \\prime }"
            }
          ]
